  `docs/plans/pipeline-agent-reports.md`.
- **Companies map (DONE 2026-08-03)**: `/map` — filterable list + Leaflet pins
  (city-level geocode via Nominatim). Prod + local geocoded (~12.1k pins).
  List follows map viewport / cluster; select flies to pin; **Open company**
  opens `CompanySheet` on `/map`. Plan: `docs/plans/companies-map.md`.
  Re-run `apps/api/scripts/geocode-companies.ts` when cities change; optional
