- **Research agent on Railway (DONE 2026-08-03)**: always-on `agent`
  service; `Dockerfile.agent` + Node 24 start script; app
  `AGENT_URL` / `AGENT_BRIDGE_SECRET`. Ops notes:
  `docs/plans/agent-railway.md`.
- **Website form leads → Screening (DONE 2026-08-05)**: Customer Question
